  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While fighting Feng Jiu Ge, he is inspired by song warrior. He wants myriad self clones to think for him so that reverse flow protection seal and other killer moves no longer take all of his concentration. Two difficulties stand in the way. The clones cannot think unless they have wisdom path thoughts, wills, or emotions. Even with a large number of those, after they have been dispersed into the clones, the result cannot collectively benefit him alone. He solves the first with an immortal killer move that uses self love Immortal Gu and affection Immortal Gu to produce a vast amount of self will. This move solves the second. He still relies on wisdom path grandmaster attainment to modify myriad self.",
